            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Defense and Security Initiatives</strong><br>\nHe has emphasized defense and security during his presidency, advocating for a European army and increased defense spending for France's military.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Cultural and Educational Projects</strong><br>\nMacron has supported cultural initiatives and educational reforms, including efforts to make French universities more competitive globally and to invest in youth programs.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Response to Global Challenges</strong><br>\nThroughout his presidency, Macron has faced global challenges like terrorism, the COVID-19 pandemic, and the war in Ukraine, with policies reflecting a balance between liberal economic values and social welfare protection.</p>\n"
              },
